.TH CHM-INSTALL-VSCODE 1
.SH NAME
chm-install-vscode \- install Visual Studio Code using an official package manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 tools/ide/install-vscode.py
.RI [ --install ]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --install
Run Flatpak/Snap, winget or Homebrew installation. Without this option, print the plan only.
.SH SAFETY
Does not download an unverified archive. Uses the host's official package manager.
